  "notes": "FORMS:\n{概|がい} (approximate, general) + {算|さん} (calculation) → rough calculation\n\nCAN FUNCTION AS:\n- Noun: {概算|がいさん}を{出|だ}す (to provide an estimate)\n- Suru-verb: {概算|がいさん}する (to make a rough estimate)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {概算|がいさん}{見積|みつも}り (rough estimate/quote)\n- {概算|がいさん}{費用|ひよう} (estimated cost)\n- {概算|がいさん}{要求|ようきゅう} (budget request - government term)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {試算|しさん} (trial calculation)\n- {見積|みつも}り (estimate, quotation)\n- {精算|せいさん} (exact calculation, settlement)\n- {概略|がいりゃく} (outline, summary)\n\nUSAGE:\nCommonly used in business contexts when discussing budgets, project costs, or preliminary planning stages.",
